<title>USA: Duke Realty files $500 mln shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Duke Realty files $500 mln shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duke Realty Investments Inc filed Friday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering of up to $300 million in common stock, preferred shares and depositary shares and up to $200 million in debt securities to be offered by Duke Realty LP.</p>
<p>The Indianapolis-based company said proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes including developing properties. No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
